category: Libs
requires: cygwin libglib2.0_0 libguile3.0_1 libsodium26
sdesc: "Yet Another Crypto Library (runtime)"
ldesc: "Basically this is my wrapper around a much better library (libsodium) with
some functions that libsodium doesn't include. In general, the libsodium
routines are used with the exception of the algorithms not in NaCl."
external-source: yacl

